## Ratchet 4: Frontmatter coverage

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| **Day-zero numerator** | <covered> |
| **Day-zero denominator** | <total> |
| **Day-zero fraction** | <covered>/<total> = <pct>% |

**Canonical command:**

```bash
total=$(find .agentile -name '*.md' | wc -l)
covered=$(find .agentile -name '*.md' | xargs -I{} sh -c 'head -1 "{}" | grep -q "^---$" && echo 1' | wc -l)
echo "$covered/$total"
```

If the project extended frontmatter scope beyond `.agentile/`,
update the `find` paths and re-run.

